{"title":"Quoting Armin Ronacher","link":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/22/armin-ronacher/","date":1792683253000,"content":"\n    <blockquote cite=\"https://twitter.com/mitsuhiko/status/2113207589978636646\"><p>As fun as AI is, we built so much bad software over the last 30 years, and now the universe is punishing us for our sins.</p></blockquote>\n<p>— <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mitsuhiko/status/2113207589978636646\">Armin Ronacher</a></p>\n\n    <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/security\">security</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/generative-ai\">generative-ai</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/armin-ronacher\">armin-ronacher</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/ai\">ai</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/ai-security-research\">ai-security-research</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/llms\">llms</a></p>\n\n\n\n","author":"Simon Willison","siteTitle":"Simon Willison’s Weblog","siteHash":"1b599216bd27a00f15d67a3ed9719c64148630c70244b6dd8e743f17cb45527e","entryHash":"10671e3c2cd06ecaf6628d9241802376192a0978c9347dea5a5b6bbc27af6c75","category":"Tech"}